{"seq":1,"slug":"tenant-data-partition-row-level-isolation","title":"租户数据分区与行级隔离（shared schema + tenant_id、RLS 强制、分区键与索引设计）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/multi-tenant-saas-commerce-isolation-billing/data-isolation-security/tenant-data-partition-row-level-isolation","wordCount":2422,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"租户数据分区与行级隔离-shared-schema-tenant_id-rls-强制-分区键与索引设计\">租户数据分区与行级隔离（shared schema + tenant_id、RLS 强制、分区键与索引设计）</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念-隔离不是二选一-而是一条连续谱\">核心概念：隔离不是二选一，而是一条连续谱</h2><p>多租户电商平台最先要落定的工程决策，不是&quot;用哪张表&quot;，而是&quot;每个租户的数据放在哪里、由谁强制分开&quot;。Microsoft Azure 架构中心把隔离度描述为从&quot;完全隔离（shared nothing）&quot;到&quot;完全共享（shared everything）&quot;的连续谱，并指出同一套架构里不同层可用不同隔离度（来源：Azure Architecture Center, <em>Tenancy Models for a Multitenant Solution</em>, 2025-06）。跨境 SaaS 电商通常走&quot;共享应用层 + 共享数据库 + <code>tenant_id</code> 列&quot;的池化（pool）路线：每租户成本最低、租户迁移时只需改标识而无需搬库，代价是每一处数据访问都必须在代码或数据库层强制带上租户谓词。</p>\n<p>三种主流数据层模型的核心差别如下：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模型</th>\n<th>隔离单元</th>\n<th>强制点</th>\n<th>单租户成本</th>\n<th>跨租户分析</th>\n<th>典型适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>shared schema + <code>tenant_id</code></td>\n<td>行</td>\n<td>应用谓词 + RLS</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n<td>最容易（同库聚合）</td>\n<td>长尾中小商家、快速 onboarding</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>schema-per-tenant</td>\n<td>schema</td>\n<td>连接时 <code>search_path</code></td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>需跨 schema UNION</td>\n<td>中等租户数、需物理分离感</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>database-per-tenant</td>\n<td>库/连接</td>\n<td>连接串/凭据</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>需 ETL 汇总</td>\n<td>大客户、强合规、噪声隔离</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>选型直接决定后面几节的写法：一旦选了 shared schema，<code>tenant_id</code> 就不再是可选字段，而是<strong>主键、外键、唯一约束、分区键和索引最左列</strong>都要携带的结构性成分。章节 <code>../1_saas-multi-tenant-model/INDEX.md</code> 讨论租户与部署的映射，本文只聚焦数据层如何把这条边界钉死。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  Req[请求携带 tenant 上下文] --&gt; MW[中间件解析 tenant_id&lt;br/&gt;写入会话变量]&#10;  MW --&gt; Map[租户映射层&lt;br/&gt;tenant_id → 分片/部署]&#10;  Map --&gt; DB[(共享数据库)]&#10;  DB --&gt; RLS{RLS 策略}&#10;  RLS --&gt;|通过| Rows[仅本租户行]&#10;  RLS --&gt;|默认拒绝| Deny[0 行 / 报错]&#10;  Rows --&gt; Part[分区裁剪]&#10;  Part --&gt; Idx[最左列 tenant_id 的复合索引]\">graph TD\n  Req[请求携带 tenant 上下文] --&gt; MW[中间件解析 tenant_id&lt;br/&gt;写入会话变量]\n  MW --&gt; Map[租户映射层&lt;br/&gt;tenant_id → 分片/部署]\n  Map --&gt; DB[(共享数据库)]\n  DB --&gt; RLS{RLS 策略}\n  RLS --&gt;|通过| Rows[仅本租户行]\n  RLS --&gt;|默认拒绝| Deny[0 行 / 报错]\n  Rows --&gt; Part[分区裁剪]\n  Part --&gt; Idx[最左列 tenant_id 的复合索引]</pre><h2 id=\"shared-schema-下-tenant_id-的建模约束与分片键\">shared schema 下 tenant_id 的建模约束与分片键</h2><p>在共享表结构里，<code>tenant_id</code> 必须出现在所有承载租户数据的表上，并进入约束定义本身，否则唯一性会在错误的作用域上被强制——两个租户的同一个 SKU 编码会互相冲突。Citus 的多租户实践给出的规则是：把租户标识作为<strong>分布列（distribution column）</strong>，让同一 <code>tenant_id</code> 的行落在同一节点，从而让 join、事务、约束都在单节点内完成（来源：Citus Data, <em>Multi-Tenant Applications</em>）。</p>\n<p>具体到 DDL，这意味着主键和外键都要是复合形式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE orders (&#10;    tenant_id   uuid   NOT NULL,&#10;    order_id    bigint NOT NULL,&#10;    created_at  timestamptz NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),&#10;    PRIMARY KEY (tenant_id, order_id),&#10;    UNIQUE (tenant_id, order_no)  -- 唯一性限定在租户内&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE TABLE order_items (&#10;    tenant_id uuid   NOT NULL,&#10;    order_id  bigint NOT NULL,&#10;    PRIMARY KEY (tenant_id, order_id, sku),&#10;    FOREIGN KEY (tenant_id, order_id) REFERENCES orders (tenant_id, order_id)&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> orders</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    tenant_id   uuid   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    order_id    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigint</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    created_at  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">timestamptz</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (tenant_id, order_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    UNIQUE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (tenant_id, order_no)  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 唯一性限定在租户内</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> order_items</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    tenant_id uuid   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    order_id  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigint</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (tenant_id, order_id, sku),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    FOREIGN KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (tenant_id, order_id) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders (tenant_id, order_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>三个容易被忽略的要点：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>外键必须含分布列/分区键</strong>。<code>FOREIGN KEY (tenant_id, order_id)</code> 而非仅 <code>(order_id)</code>——否则引用完整性检查无法定位到单节点，跨租户误引用也无法被拦下。</li>\n<li><strong>全局共享数据用引用表</strong>。国家代码、汇率表、支付渠道清单这类所有租户共享的字典，应作为引用表（Citus 的 <code>create_reference_table</code>）复制到每个节点，而不是塞进某租户的分布表。</li>\n<li><strong>大租户需要可搬迁</strong>。当某个大卖家的写入量压垮共享节点时，Citus 的 <code>isolate_tenant_to_new_shard(&#39;companies&#39;, 5, &#39;CASCADE&#39;)</code> 可把该租户及关联表单独拆成分片，再用 <code>citus_move_shard_placement()</code> 迁到专属节点——&quot;池化起步、按需升格为竖井&quot;的平滑路径。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"postgresql-行级安全-rls-让数据库而非应用强制边界\">PostgreSQL 行级安全（RLS）：让数据库而非应用强制边界</h2><p>应用层谓词的风险在于&quot;漏一处就漏一片&quot;：一个忘记加 <code>WHERE tenant_id = ?</code> 的报表查询、一个拼接字符串的旧接口，都会造成跨租户数据泄露。PostgreSQL 的行级安全把这条约束下沉到数据库：<code>ALTER TABLE accounts ENABLE ROW LEVEL SECURITY</code> 之后，该表所有行选择与修改都必须被某条策略允许，<strong>没有策略时的默认行为是拒绝</strong>（default-deny），且 <code>TRUNCATE</code>、<code>REFERENCES</code> 这类整表操作不受 RLS 限制（来源：PostgreSQL 官方文档 <em>Row Security Policies</em>）。</p>\n<p>策略的核心是 <code>USING</code> 与 <code>WITH CHECK</code> 的分工：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>子句</th>\n<th>作用对象</th>\n<th>失败后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>USING (expr)</code></td>\n<td>已存在行的可见性/可修改性</td>\n<td>该行被静默过滤，<code>UPDATE 0</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>WITH CHECK (expr)</code></td>\n<td>被 INSERT/UPDATE 写入的新行</td>\n<td>抛错 <code>new row violates WITH CHECK OPTION</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>只写 <code>USING</code> 时，PostgreSQL 会隐式复制一份同表达式的 <code>WITH CHECK</code>，所以 <code>CREATE POLICY tenant_isolation ON orders USING (tenant_id = current_setting(&#39;app.tenant_id&#39;)::uuid)</code> 一条策略就同时防住读越权和写越权。</p>\n<p>多策略的组合语义要记牢：默认策略是<strong>宽松型（permissive）</strong>，彼此以 <code>OR</code> 合并；标记 <code>AS RESTRICTIVE</code> 的策略以 <code>AND</code> 合并——这是&quot;先给个大权限，再加一道硬闸&quot;的表达，例如 <code>CREATE POLICY admin_all ... USING (true)</code> 放开全表，再用 <code>CREATE POLICY admin_local_only ON orders AS RESTRICTIVE ... USING (pg_catalog.inet_client_addr() IS NULL)</code> 把管理员限制在本地网络。</p>\n<p>强制点还有三处必须显式处理，否则策略形同虚设：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>表所有者默认绕过 RLS</strong>，超级用户和带 <code>BYPASSRLS</code> 角色的则<strong>始终</strong>绕过。要让所有者本人也受策略约束，需 <code>ALTER TABLE ... FORCE ROW LEVEL SECURITY</code>——它不去约束超级用户。</li>\n<li><strong>引用完整性检查（唯一、主键、外键）始终绕过 RLS</strong>，官方文档指出这可能形成隐蔽信道（covert channel）信息泄露，因此靠 RLS 保护的表更适合用含 <code>tenant_id</code> 的复合约束，而非依赖跨租户可见的唯一键。</li>\n<li><strong>备份等场景</strong>，<code>SET row_security = off</code> 不绕过 RLS，而是让原本会被过滤的查询直接报错，避免&quot;静默少导了数据&quot;的事故。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"分区键与索引-让隔离同时是性能结构\">分区键与索引：让隔离同时是性能结构</h2><p>在 shared schema 里，<code>tenant_id</code> 既是安全边界又是访问路径第一段。分区和索引围绕它设计，隔离就不会带来额外开销。</p>\n<p><strong>分区策略。</strong> PostgreSQL 声明式分区支持 <code>PARTITION BY LIST</code>（每个分区列一组显式键值）、<code>RANGE</code>（下界含、上界不含）和 <code>HASH</code>（按 <code>hash(k) % modulus = remainder</code> 落位）。对租户数可控且体量差异大的平台，<code>LIST (tenant_id)</code> 或大租户独享分区最直观；对海量小租户叠加时间维度的订单表，常见做法是按 <code>RANGE (created_at)</code> 分区、以 <code>HASH (tenant_id)</code> 做子分区，兼顾时间归档与租户分散。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE orders (&#10;    tenant_id  uuid NOT NULL,&#10;    order_id   bigint NOT NULL,&#10;    created_at timestamptz NOT NULL&#10;) PARTITION BY RANGE (created_at);&#10;&#10;CREATE TABLE orders_2026m10 PARTITION OF orders&#10;    FOR VALUES FROM (&#39;2026-10-01&#39;) TO (&#39;2026-11-01&#39;)&#10;    PARTITION BY HASH (tenant_id);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> orders</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    tenant_id  uuid </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    order_id   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigint</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    created_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">timestamptz</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> RANGE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (created_at);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> orders_2026m10</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> OF orders</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    FOR</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> VALUES</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2026-10-01'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2026-11-01'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> HASH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (tenant_id);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>唯一约束必须含分区键。</strong> 官方文档规定：分区表上的唯一/主键约束，其列必须包含<strong>全部</strong>分区键列，且分区键不能是表达式或函数调用。因此按 <code>created_at</code> 分区时 <code>PRIMARY KEY (tenant_id, order_id)</code> 不合法——分区内的索引只能约束本分区，边界须防止跨分区重复。合法写法是 <code>PRIMARY KEY (tenant_id, order_id, created_at)</code>，或按 <code>LIST (tenant_id)</code> 分区从而让 <code>tenant_id</code> 天然进入键。</p>\n<p><strong>分区裁剪（pruning）。</strong> 裁剪由分区边界驱动，与索引无关，可在计划期和执行期发生，<code>EXPLAIN</code> 中体现为 <code>Subplans Removed</code> 或 <code>(never executed)</code>。查询只要带上分区键谓词，扫描范围就限定到相关分区。</p>\n<p><strong>索引的最左列。</strong> 复合 B-tree 只有<strong>最左列</strong>能被单独用来满足谓词。主键 <code>(tenant_id, order_id)</code> 无法给&quot;只按 <code>order_id</code> 过滤&quot;的策略提供可用索引；反之，若策略和查询都按 <code>tenant_id</code> 过滤，则必须以 <code>tenant_id</code> 打头，如 <code>CREATE INDEX idx_orders_tenant_created ON orders (tenant_id, created_at DESC)</code>。</p>\n<p>Supabase 的 RLS 指南把这条总结为一句话：<strong>为每一个出现在 RLS 谓词里的列建索引</strong>（<code>tenant_id</code>、<code>team_id</code>、<code>user_id</code>），并提醒组合 B-tree 只有最左列有效，因此仅有 <code>(team_id, user_id)</code> 主键时，针对 <code>user_id</code> 的策略仍需单独建索引。</p>\n<h2 id=\"性能边界与防御性验证\">性能边界与防御性验证</h2><p>RLS 策略表达式<strong>对每个候选行求值，且先于用户查询的条件与函数</strong>——唯二例外是 <code>leakproof</code> 函数，优化器才可把它提到行安全检查之前。这决定成本的量级：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>scan</mtext></msub><mo>≈</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>pred</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>index</mtext></msub><mo>≈</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>pred</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{scan}} \\approx N \\cdot c_{\\text{pred}}, \\qquad C_{\\text{index}} \\approx \\log N \\cdot c_{\\text{pred}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">scan</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">pred</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">index</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">pred</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 为候选行数、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>pred</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{\\text{pred}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">pred</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为单次谓词求值成本。谓词列无可用索引时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 是全表行数，租户一多即退化为顺序扫描；以 <code>tenant_id</code> 打头的索引使 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 骤降到本租户行数，再叠加分区裁剪，命中分区数从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>把常数项压下来的三个惯例：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>把逐行求值的函数包进子查询。</strong> 用 <code>using ((select auth.uid()) = user_id)</code> 而非 <code>using (auth.uid() = user_id)</code>：子查询形式促使 PostgreSQL 把它当作 initPlan <strong>每条语句求值一次</strong>，而非每行一次。前提是函数结果与当前行无关；<code>auth.jwt()</code> 同样适用。</li>\n<li><strong>用 <code>security definer</code> 函数做受保护查询。</strong> 复杂权限判断或互相引用的策略（如 <code>lists</code> 与 <code>list_members</code>）可用以所有者身份运行的函数打破递归；配套纪律是放在未暴露的私有 schema、设 <code>set search_path = &#39;&#39;</code>、内部全用 schema 限定名、只授予所需角色执行权。若所有者缺 <code>BYPASSRLS</code> 或目标表用了强制 RLS，递归仍存在。</li>\n<li><strong>视图要用 <code>security_invoker = true</code>。</strong> PostgreSQL 15 起支持，使视图尊重调用者自己的 RLS 策略；更早版本需撤销客户端角色对视图的访问或把视图放进未暴露 schema。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>策略必须被测试，而不是被相信。</strong> Supabase 建议为每张受保护表写 pgTAP 测试，对 <code>anon</code> 与 <code>authenticated</code> 两种角色、<code>select/insert/update/delete</code> 四种操作逐一断言允许与拒绝：用 <code>throws_ok</code> 验证缺权限或 <code>WITH CHECK</code> 违例，用 <code>is_empty</code> 配合 <code>returning</code> 验证 <code>USING</code> 把行过滤掉，并在一次被拒绝的写入后再读一次、证明目标行原封不动。跨境电商还应在数据层之外对齐 GDPR 删除权与数据本地化要求，即 <code>tenant_id</code> 到地理部署的映射必须可查询、可审计——这正是 <code>../3_tenant-billing-metering/INDEX.md</code> 的计费归属所依赖的同一套租户标识。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>隔离是从 shared nothing 到 shared everything 的连续谱；跨境 SaaS 电商常用&quot;共享库 + <code>tenant_id</code> 列&quot;的池化模型，以最低单租户成本换取快速 onboarding。</li>\n<li>shared schema 下 <code>tenant_id</code> 是结构性成分：进主键、外键、唯一约束、分区键，并当索引最左列。</li>\n<li>RLS 把边界下沉到数据库：<code>ENABLE ROW LEVEL SECURITY</code> 后无策略即默认拒绝；<code>USING</code> 管可见与可改、<code>WITH CHECK</code> 管写入；宽松策略以 <code>OR</code> 合并、<code>AS RESTRICTIVE</code> 以 <code>AND</code> 合并。</li>\n<li>表所有者默认绕过、超级用户与 <code>BYPASSRLS</code> 始终绕过，需 <code>FORCE ROW LEVEL SECURITY</code> 才能约束所有者；引用完整性检查始终绕过 RLS，可能形成隐蔽信道。</li>\n<li>分区裁剪由边界驱动、与索引无关；分区表的唯一/主键必须含全部分区键列；为每个 RLS 谓词列建索引、把逐行函数包成 <code>(select ...)</code>、视图启用 <code>security_invoker</code>，并用 pgTAP 逐角色逐操作测试策略。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"租户数据分区与行级隔离（shared schema + tenant_id、RLS 强制、分区键与索引设计）","id":"租户数据分区与行级隔离-shared-schema-tenant_id-rls-强制-分区键与索引设计"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：隔离不是二选一，而是一条连续谱","id":"核心概念-隔离不是二选一-而是一条连续谱"},{"level":2,"text":"shared schema 下 tenant_id 的建模约束与分片键","id":"shared-schema-下-tenant_id-的建模约束与分片键"},{"level":2,"text":"PostgreSQL 行级安全（RLS）：让数据库而非应用强制边界","id":"postgresql-行级安全-rls-让数据库而非应用强制边界"},{"level":2,"text":"分区键与索引：让隔离同时是性能结构","id":"分区键与索引-让隔离同时是性能结构"},{"level":2,"text":"性能边界与防御性验证","id":"性能边界与防御性验证"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"租户套餐、权益与配额门控（plan/entitlement 建模、功能开关、限额与超限降级）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/multi-tenant-saas-commerce-isolation-billing/saas-multi-tenant-model/tenant-tier-entitlement-quota"},"next":{"title":"租户上下文鉴权与越权防护（tenant-scoped RBAC、跨租户 IDOR/cache/search 泄漏、后台与集成账号边界）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/multi-tenant-saas-commerce-isolation-billing/data-isolation-security/tenant-context-authz-cross-tenant-prevention"}}